	(text "Copmax AW-10-15-20 RS485 sniffer/logger (ESP32 + MAX3485)  -  KUN LYT: DE/RE-jumper paa GND. Styret skrivning: jumper paa GPIO4."
		(at 20.32 15.24 0)
